Enable an installed component instance

Usage:
  eshu component enable <component-id> [flags]

Flags:
      --claims                  Enable workflow claims for this component instance
      --component-home string   Component registry home directory
      --config string           Path to component instance configuration
      --dry-run                 Validate activation and render the planned result without writing component state
  -h, --help                    help for enable
      --instance string         Collector instance ID to enable
      --json                    Write stable JSON output
      --mode string             Collector activation mode (default "manual")

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
